  "releaseNotes": "2.5.61: Logging hardening and optimization. Fixes CustomTextFormatter/IOptionsMonitor subscription memory leak in LogEventExtensions.ToLogEntryModel; adds configurable LoggingConfig.MaxBodyLogLength (default 256 KB, 0 to disable) with LogSanitizer.TruncateForLog; normalizes Error/Warning/Information levels and adds HttpMethod, StatusCode, and CorrelationId propagation across RestApiLoggingMiddleware, HttpLoggingHandler, and RabbitMqLogHelper; skips binary content-types in HttpLoggingHandler; adds BusinessLogHelper.Debug and DebugWithTraceId.",
